cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Leaf Scanner"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based tool for measuring leaf area from a photo. The user
  photographs a leaf next to a calibration swatch of known area, and the
  tool estimates the leaf's real-world area from the ratio of leaf to
  calibration pixel counts. Runs entirely client-side in the browser.
